### Get all shoes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shoes
Accept: application/json

### Get shoe by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shoes/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a new shoe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "SHOE-001",
  "modelName": "Runner Pro",
  "color": "Black",
  "size": 42.5,
  "initialStock": 50,
  "costPrice": 45.00,
  "retailPrice": 89.99,
  "wholesalePrice": 70.00
}

### Update an existing shoe
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/shoes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "SHOE-001",
  "modelName": "Runner Pro X",
  "color": "Black",
  "size": 42.5,
  "initialStock": 60,
  "costPrice": 47.00,
  "retailPrice": 92.99,
  "wholesalePrice": 72.00
}

### Delete a shoe
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/shoes/1



